7. EXCLUDE MUSA3ED FROM PLUGIN SCOPE

Musa3ed is handled as a separate task.

If Musa3ed functionality appears in the BRD/PRD, exclude it from the current Digitoid feature review.

Apply this rule within the AI plugin instructions, not only in the UI.

7.1 Exclusion Rules

* Do not analyze Musa3ed-specific features.
* Do not validate Musa3ed-specific designs.
* Do not generate Musa3ed-specific findings.
* Do not create Musa3ed implementation tasks.
* Do not ask unnecessary Musa3ed clarification questions.
* Do not include Musa3ed work in the Claude Code execution plan.
* Do not describe Musa3ed as a related feature or dependency merely because it appears in the PRD.

Preserve all remaining in-scope requirements.

If a Musa3ed reference creates a genuine ambiguity about the boundary of an in-scope requirement, ask only the minimum necessary clarification.

Do not remove unrelated requirements.

